# Placeholder mesh for parts that need a physical/visual entry but no real
# geometry. Must NOT be an empty file: Stonefish builds a convex hull from
# the vertices, and a hull with zero points segfaults Bullet's GJK support
# query the first time anything touches it (observed as stonefish_simulator
# SIGSEGV in btConvexShape::localGetSupportVertexWithoutMarginNonVirtual).
# A 1 cm tetrahedron keeps the hull valid while being physically negligible.
v 0.005 0.0 0.0
v -0.005 0.005 0.0
v -0.005 -0.005 0.0
v 0.0 0.0 0.005
f 1 3 2
f 1 2 4
f 2 3 4
f 1 4 3
